      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/43a26b/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-04-15T01:22:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I see on the Wiki that Heroic Infinitor and Chokepoint have challenge modes now, added since the original pdf document. Also that the language has been changed for Ambuscade from the original pdfs.</p><p>My questions:</p><p>Where did these additions and change come from?</p><p>Are they official?</p><p>Is there a challenge mode for Unstable Kismet?</p><p>Will the Heroic Infinitor and Chokepoing get the little \"story\" line that explains the challenge the way the others have?</p><p>Will Villains be getting challenge modes?</p><p>Will Oblivaeon and his scions get them?</p><p>I've been hoping they'd all have them eventually and have been planning to put them all on cards I can slide under the villain card so they show the challenge like an addional box of text and am curious if the set will ever be officially complete before I create them.</p>",
