      "created_at": "2017-04-15T01:32:10.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>What's on the wiki is official and came from the video game implementation which Christopher approved if added and/or changed. &nbsp;Ambuscade is the only known one to have a major rewording change so far. &nbsp; We don't have a challenge mode for Unstable Kismet or VotM yet. &nbsp;As to story that's up to GtG who I assume will release an updated Challenge Mode PDF at some point. &nbsp; Christopher has said in other threads there will be a challenge mode for OblivAeon but gave no indication of how that will work. &nbsp;</p>",
