      "created_at": "2017-04-17T14:48:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah don’t expect any balance from them. Besides, charged attacks going off with a sonic mine or two in play can result in 12,  16 or even more dmg on standard. I’ve lost a couple Ambuscade standard because of that.</p>",
