      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/f04885/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2017-04-18T05:00:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Though, I really do like Chokepoint’s challenge mode a lot. She’s extra powerful against heroes that rely on destroying their own things, like ongoings. I thought a game with omnitron U, super scientific Tachyon, Ra, and Skyscraper in the enclave would be doable, but she’s destroyed me twice in a row now. And you’re forced to play her much differently.</p>",
